  <item>
    <title>中国零食故事系列2：薯片商战，乐事vs品客、可比克、上好佳</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/687f1420a9dec9250087fed8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">687f1420a9dec9250087fed8</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Jul 2025 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>中国零食故事系列，上一期聊了辣条，这期我们来聊薯片。</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>记得点击“订阅”，不错过每期更新~</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播丨刘皇叔</span></p><span></span><p><span>刘皇叔：曾是某万人国企的中层领导，有过4次创业经历，现在主业是做教育直播，副业是做自媒体，还有闲鱼卖货。</span></p><span></span><p><span>公号：商业麻辣烫</span></p><span></span><p><span>想进入听友群，跟皇叔近距离接触，可以关注公号【商业麻辣烫】，回复入群即可。</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友投稿邮箱：8395386@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a> &nbsp;前言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">01:52</a> &nbsp;乐事故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> &nbsp;品客故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> &nbsp;可比克故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> &nbsp;上好佳故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">29:51</a> &nbsp;薯片行业现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> &nbsp;无用的冷知识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1928">32:08</a> &nbsp;片尾曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2151">35:51</a> &nbsp;彩蛋：念评论</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>乐事薯片创始人埃尔默.杜林</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>品客的标志性logo</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>化学家弗雷德里克 · 鲍尔（ Fredric Baur ）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>友商（ 图左 ）的薯片不是双曲抛物面，右边品客的是双曲抛物面</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>如今，大家纪念鲍尔的做法还是献上一罐品客</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>数学家亚历山大 · 利帕（ Alexander L.Liepa ）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>吉恩 · 沃尔夫</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>可比克创始人许世辉</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>周杰伦给可比克做的广告</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>达利集团产品线</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>上好佳创始人施恭旗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主要参考资料：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《【十万个品牌故事】乐事薯片：一直在超越，2019年收入671.61亿美元》，品牌风云榜</span></p><span></span><p><span>《乐事无限全线焕新，以“醇香难挡”精准定位，锚定社交零食新风口》，时代财经</span></p><span></span><p><span>《品客要被士力架收购了，其实你当年吃的不是真“薯片”》差评X.PIN</span></p><span></span><p><span>《突发！美国监管机构批准玛氏360亿美元吞并品客母公司，比箭牌更大的收购案要落地了？》，快消</span></p><span></span><p><span>《今年最大零食并购要来了》，并购最前线</span></p><span></span><p><span>《从白手起家、福建首富 到主动退市 达利食品创始人许世辉时运跌宕的商业人生》，财联社</span></p><span></span><p><span>《当地方特色邂逅年轻化表达，可比克“再造”薯片》，零售商业财经</span></p><span></span><p><span>《“上好佳”父子： 搭建中外友好交流的桥梁》，中国城市报</span></p><span></span><p><span>《党群同心·护航进博丨从“头回客”到“回头客”，上好佳如“七”而至》，澎湃新闻</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：</span></p><span></span><p><span>吃不胖的肉 - 优秀少年团</span></p>]]></description>
