  <item>
    <title>中国零食故事系列1：辣条商战，卫龙vs麻辣王子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685a89352a38b4d9794ce4d7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685a89352a38b4d9794ce4d7</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 11:19:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是《商业麻辣烫》的第五期，作为一个大老爷们，我今天要聊聊女生最喜欢的零食。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天先从辣条开始，后面会陆续更新其他零食系列。</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>记得点击“订阅”，不错过每期更新~</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播丨刘皇叔</span></p><span></span><p><span>刘皇叔：曾是某万人国企的中层领导，有过4次创业经历，现在主业是做教育直播，副业是做自媒体，还有闲鱼卖货，研究过上百个网络项目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>公号：商业麻辣烫</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>想进入听友群，跟皇叔近距离接触，可以关注公号【商业麻辣烫】，回复入群即可。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>听友投稿邮箱：8395386@qq.com</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="37">00:37</a> &nbsp;前言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> &nbsp;刘卫平早年经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a> &nbsp;创业经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">16:11</a> &nbsp;卫龙几次破圈营销</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1192">19:52</a> &nbsp;危机与破局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a> &nbsp;麻辣王子创业史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2037">33:57</a> &nbsp;辣条行业现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2111">35:11</a> &nbsp;无用的冷知识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2233">37:13</a> &nbsp;片尾曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2427">40:27</a> &nbsp;彩蛋：念评论</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>卫龙创始人刘卫平</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fln47Q2X--wjPUVUmwr6pIIXxPMY.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>杨幂代言卫龙产品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlPIAAyUYUcIKfZZ61Chs4HKxdkb.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>卫龙模仿iphone7的海报</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpHXZ7e64OTP559XiDT1mB536ERp.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>卫龙线下旗舰店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlOMTmL4_R8c69RtYj3bqm1k5O99.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq6jvNskEA1rAANNkfRrgaLjq2zo.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>卫龙与《蛋仔派对》开展联名合作</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuE-GTRUhlhrU1G6Hr8QTb_8LcXl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>辣条风味大鸡肉条</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhgAfD5aJjSTxxbbKP4WaCwLIN1S.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>卫龙2022年1215日于港交所上市。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtX508YngjowQ_bwnlpYhQ0W1-aC.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>卫龙与麻辣王子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsGiQguNmWLQuKBjXAh5SXxcNyEo.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>十国选手角逐“国际麻辣王”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq3fwjFeImehS4-mTCFM9HSF-nPU.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主要参考资料：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《你的童年回忆上市了，背后的他坐拥百亿身家》，付玉梅 王喆宁，环球人物网</span></p><span></span><p><span>《从“国货潮品”到“全球零食”》，河南日报</span></p><span></span><p><span>《卫龙美味：稳居龙头地位 引领行业发展》，咸宁新闻网</span></p><span></span><p><span>《万物皆有源：从传统小吃到国民美味，揭秘卫龙开创辣条新纪元》，新华网</span></p><span></span><p><span>《辣条越卖越贵 卫龙预计2024上半年净利超6亿》，田柳</span><strong><span>，</span></strong><span>海量财经</span></p><span></span><p><span>《卫龙的“路人缘”正在变淡》，罗莉，蓝鲸新闻</span></p><span></span><p><span>《卫龙去年营收超62亿：“双轮驱动”稳健增长，辣味边界持续扩张》，</span><em><span>刘欢，</span></em><span>新京报</span></p><span></span><p><span>《卫龙这波"辣"辣翻天，股价飙增127%，营收利润双双涨超20%》，港股研究所</span></p><span></span><p><span>《卫龙辣条年轻化出击，在千亿市场中演绎品牌进阶之道》，每日上海网</span></p><span></span><p><span>《人民网“透明工厂”走进麻辣王子 溯源辣条的“前世今生”》，人民网</span></p><span></span><p><span>《麻辣王子25周年：从“小作坊”到行业领军者的逆袭之路》，红网</span></p><span></span><p><span>《辣条市场规模将破千亿，麻辣味成未来趋势》，湖南日报</span></p><span></span><p><span>《辣条市场“北卫龙、南麻辣王子”竞争升级，麻辣王子加速全国布局》，环球网</span></p><span></span><p><span>《14.5%消费占比赶超四川湖南！广东登顶2024年全国辣条线上购买量第一省》，深圳新闻网</span></p><span></span><p><span>《2025年中国麻辣辣条行业规模现状及未来展望，市场集中度低，品牌梯队初现》，李英杰，华经情报网</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>片尾曲：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>辣妹子 - 宋祖英</span></p>]]></description>
